# ---- Signing material and secrets: never commit ----
*.jks
*.keystore
# Shared, non-secret DEBUG signing key (public password "android"), so CI and local debug APKs install
# over each other. Never use it for release; release signing comes from CI secrets.
!/app/debug.keystore
